00:49:08,571 --> 00:49:14,571
Havoc is a 2005 crime drama film directed by Barbara Kopple from a screenplay
by Stephen Gaghan, who wrote the story with Jessica Kaplan.

13
00:53:14,285 --> 00:53:20,285
The film stars Anne Hathaway, Bijou Phillips, and Mike Vogel.

14
00:57:20,000 --> 00:57:26,000
It follows the lives of wealthy Los Angeles teenagers whose exposure to hip hop culture inspires them to imitate the gangster lifestyle and engage in slum
tourism; they run into trouble when they encounter a gang of drug dealers, discovering they are not as street-wise as they had thought.

15
01:01:25,714 --> 01:01:31,714
Shiri Appleby, Freddy Rodriguez, Joseph Gordon-Levitt, Channing Tatum,
Michael Biehn, and Laura San Giacomo appear in supporting roles.

16
01:05:31,428 --> 01:05:37,428
It is an international co-production between the United States and Germany.

17
01:09:37,142 --> 01:09:43,142
Havoc made its world premiere at the Filmfest München on June 26,
2005, and was shown at several film festivals.

18
01:13:42,857 --> 01:13:48,857
